{"strongs": "H8393", "word": "תְּבוּאָה", "translit": "te.vu.ah", "root": "תבואה", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "product, revenue", "definition": "תְּבוּאָה noun feminine proventus , product, revenue — ׳ תּ absolute Ps 107:37 + 3 t.; construct תְּבוּאַת Lev 23:39 + 11 t.; suffix תְּבוּאָתִי Job 31:12 ; Prov 8:19 תְּבוּאָתְּךָ Deut 14:28 + 2 t.; תְּבוּאָתֶ֑ךָ Prov 3:9 תְּכוּאָתוֺ Lev 19:25 + Ezek 48:18 Qr ( Kt תבואתה ), תְּבוּאָתֹה Jer 2:3 תְּבוּאָתָהּ Exod 23:10 + 7 t. + Ezek 48:18 Kt (so Co ); תְּבוּאָתֵנוּ Lev 25:20 plural תְּבוּאֹת Lev 25:15 + 4 t.; תְּכוּאוֺת Prov 14:4 ; Prov 16:8 תְּבוּאֹתֵיכֶם Jer 12:13 — 1. product, yield , usually of earth (= crops, etc.) הָאָרֶץ ׳ תּ Exod 23:10 ; Lev 19:25 ; Lev 23:29 ; Lev 25:3 ; Lev 25:7 (used as food for man & beast, compare v Lev 25:22 ) Josh 5:12 , compare Neh 9:37 ; Lev 25:15 ; Lev 25:16 , also Ezek 48:18 in Gen 47:24 ׳ בַּתּ must = of the crops ( בּ partitive, compare בְּ I. 2. b ; ᵐ5 strike out בְּ ); שָׂדֶה ׳ ת 2Kgs 8:6 ; 2Chr 31:5 כֶּרֶם ׳ תּ Deut 22:9 compare Ps 107:37 ׳ לָחֶם תּ חָאֲדָמָה Isa 30:23 גֹּרֶן ׳ תּ & יָ֑קֶב ׳ תּ Num 18:30 זֶרַע ׳ תּ Deut 14:22 דָּגָן ׳ תּ 2Chr 32:38 as property of husbandmen, or people Lev 25:20 ; Lev 16:25 ; Deut 26:12 ; Prov 3:9 crops as determined by season, שָׁ֑מֶשׁ ׳ תּ Deut 33:14 (|| גֶרֶשׁ יְרָחִים ); yield of a year שָׁנָה Lev 25:12 ; Lev 25:22 compare v Lev 25:21 ׳ עָשָׂה תּ , subject שָׁנָה . 2. a. income, revenue , in general Job 31:12 (almost = possessions) Prov 10:16 ; Prov 14:4 ; Prov 15:6 ; Prov 16:8 ; Eccl 5:9 compare Isa 23:3 (revenue of Tyre from trade with Egypt in bread stuffs). \\ \\ b. figurative gain of wisdom חָכְמָה ׳ תּ Prov 3:14 ; Prov 8:19 product of lips ( שְׂפָתָיו ׳ תּ ) Prov 18:20 , i.e. results of his speech (|| פְּרִי פִיאִֿישׁ ); of Israel as Yahweh's product Jer 2:3 of Israel's wickedness Jer 12:13 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB950')\">BDB950</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8393')\">H8393</entry>]</h1><